---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal title="Terms of Service" description="Terms of Service for iptvsubscription.top: how our IPTV subscriptions work, acceptable use, payments, availability, and your responsibilities.">
  <p>
    By ordering and using a subscription from {site.domain}, you agree to these Terms of Service.
    Please read them carefully before placing an order.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Service</h2>
  <p>
    We provide access to media streaming services intended for personal, non-commercial use. Each
    subscription is licensed for a single active connection unless otherwise stated.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Account & activation</h2>
  <p>
    You are responsible for keeping your login details secure. Do not share or resell your
    subscription. We reserve the right to suspend accounts that are shared beyond the permitted
    number of connections.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Acceptable use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Use the service only for lawful, personal viewing.</li>
    <li>Do not redistribute, rebroadcast, or resell the service.</li>
    <li>Do not attempt to disrupt or reverse engineer the service.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Payments</h2>
  <p>
    Prices are shown at checkout and are billed for the term you select. Subscriptions do not
    auto-renew unless stated; you may renew manually before expiry.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Availability</h2>
  <p>
    We aim for high uptime but do not guarantee uninterrupted service. Channel line-ups and
    content availability may change without notice.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the service after changes means
    you accept the updated terms.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms? Email us at {site.email}.</p>
</Legal>
